  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:04.550" end="00:07.740" ttm:agent="v1">내 나이 사십, babe</p>
      <p begin="00:07.740" end="00:11.740" ttm:agent="v1">울 엄마 귀한 자식, babe</p>
      <p begin="00:11.740" end="00:15.480" ttm:agent="v1">직업은 댄스 가수, babe</p>
      <p begin="00:15.480" end="00:18.050" ttm:agent="v1">15년째 딴따라</p>
      <p begin="00:18.050" end="00:19.920" ttm:agent="v1">Ah, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:19.920" end="00:21.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">기술보다는 예술이 (I love it)</p>
      <p begin="00:21.670" end="00:23.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">실력보다는 매력이 (I love it)</p>
      <p begin="00:23.720" end="00:25.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">품격보다는 파격이 (I love it)</p>
      <p begin="00:25.420" end="00:27.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">사치보다는 가치가 좋아 (I love it)</p>
      <p begin="00:27.440" end="00:29.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">자신을 (love it), 여러분도 (love it)</p>
      <p begin="00:29.460" end="00:32.270" ttm:agent="v1">앞뒤 양옆 사람들, I love it so much</p>
      <p begin="00:32.270" end="00:36.100" ttm:agent="v1">남 걱정에 잠은 자셨냐? 니 시방 밥은 자셨냐?</p>
      <p begin="00:36.100" end="00:39.080" ttm:agent="v1">생선을 먹을 땐 가시 발라먹어</p>
      <p begin="00:39.080" end="00:43.220" ttm:agent="v1">수박을 먹을 때는 씨 발라먹어</p>
      <p begin="00:43.220" end="00:46.920" ttm:agent="v1">날 좋아하는 분들 내 사랑 먹어</p>
      <p begin="00:46.920" end="00:52.690" ttm:agent="v1">욕하고 모욕하고 그랬다 카더라 카는 분들 모여 이거나 먹어</p>
      <p begin="00:52.690" end="00:56.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I love it, I love it, I love it (oh yes)</p>
      <p begin="00:56.480" end="01:00.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I love it, I love it, I love it (유후)</p>
      <p begin="01:00.200" end="01:03.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I love it, I love it, I love it (I love it)</p>
      <p begin="01:03.900" end="01:07.660" ttm:agent="v1">만사가 다 오케이야, 어절씨구 옹헤야</p>
      <p begin="01:07.660" end="01:11.030" ttm:agent="v1">We like to party, babe</p>
      <p begin="01:11.030" end="01:14.870" ttm:agent="v1">가끔은 추억 팔이, babe</p>
      <p begin="01:14.870" end="01:18.620" ttm:agent="v1">그 추억은 수억짜리, babe</p>
      <p begin="01:18.620" end="01:21.450" ttm:agent="v1">그 돈 줘도 안 팔아</p>
      <p begin="01:21.450" end="01:23.250" ttm:agent="v1">Ah, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:23.250" end="01:25.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">개미보단 베짱이 (I love it)</p>
      <p begin="01:25.180" end="01:26.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">반칙보단 변칙이 (I love it)</p>
      <p begin="01:26.970" end="01:28.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">화풀이보단 뒤풀이 (I love it)</p>
      <p begin="01:28.760" end="01:30.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">선비보단 좀비가 좋아 (I love it)</p>
      <p begin="01:30.870" end="01:32.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">나의 fan (love it), 안티 (love it)</p>
      <p begin="01:32.760" end="01:35.520" ttm:agent="v1">앞뒤 양옆 사람들, I love you so much</p>
      <p begin="01:35.520" end="01:39.410" ttm:agent="v1">남 걱정에 잠은 자셨냐? 니 시방 밥은 자셨냐?</p>
      <p begin="01:39.410" end="01:42.550" ttm:agent="v1">생선을 먹을 땐 가시 발라먹어</p>
      <p begin="01:42.550" end="01:46.040" ttm:agent="v1">수박을 먹을 때는 씨 발라먹어</p>
      <p begin="01:46.040" end="01:50.080" ttm:agent="v1">날 좋아하는 분들 내 사랑 먹어</p>
      <p begin="01:50.080" end="01:55.750" ttm:agent="v1">욕하고 모욕하고 그랬다 카더라 카는 분들 모여 이거나 먹어</p>
      <p begin="01:55.750" end="01:59.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I love it, I love it, I love it (oh yes)</p>
      <p begin="01:59.790" end="02:02.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I love it, I love it, I love it (유후)</p>
      <p begin="02:02.820" end="02:07.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I love it, I love it, I love it (I love it)</p>
      <p begin="02:07.380" end="02:12.940" ttm:agent="v1">만사가 다 오케이야, 어절씨구 옹헤야</p>
      <p begin="02:12.940" end="02:14.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Don't like that)</p>
      <p begin="02:14.690" end="02:16.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Don't, don't like that)</p>
      <p begin="02:16.660" end="02:18.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Don't like that)</p>
      <p begin="02:18.330" end="02:19.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Don't, don't like that)</p>
      <p begin="02:19.470" end="02:24.470" ttm:agent="v1">난 극단적인 놈 중간을 몰라요</p>
      <p begin="02:24.470" end="02:27.150" ttm:agent="v1">이 정도는 껌, 껌, 껌, 껌</p>
      <p begin="02:27.150" end="02:32.060" ttm:agent="v1">난 끝장 보는 놈 중간이 없어요</p>
      <p begin="02:32.060" end="02:35.560" ttm:agent="v1">누워서 떡, 떡, 떡, 먹</p>
      <p begin="02:35.560" end="02:37.060" ttm:agent="v1">한번 더</p>
      <p begin="02:36.260" end="02:39.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I love it, I love it, I love it (oh yes)</p>
      <p begin="02:39.960" end="02:43.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I love it, I love it, I love it (유후)</p>
      <p begin="02:43.920" end="02:47.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I love it, I love it, I love it (I love it)</p>
      <p begin="02:47.690" end="02:51.930" ttm:agent="v1">만사가 다 오케이야, 어절씨구 옹헤야</p>
      <p begin="02:51.930" end="02:55.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(오-오-오-오-오-오-오) 좋아, 좋아, 좋아, 좋아</p>
      <p begin="02:55.950" end="02:59.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(오-오-오-오-오-오-오) 참좋아, 아주 좋아</p>
      <p begin="02:59.840" end="03:03.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(오-오-오-오-오-오-오) 좋아, 좋아, 좋아, 좋아</p>
